    <rigor-reason>Task tags include 'bff-api','testing','integration-test'; TEST-MODIFYING override — unconditional FULL per root CLAUDE.md §8 override row. Sweeps entire BFF service surface for tenant-isolation invariant compliance.</rigor-reason>
